# When displaying chess games given in algebraic notation (preference)

Standing user preference: When displaying chess games given in algebraic notation, export each move as an 8×8 markdown grid where each cell contains a period (.) unless a piece occupies it.

## Conventions
- When displaying chess games given in algebraic notation, export each move as an 8×8 markdown grid where each cell contains a period (.) unless a piece occupies it.

